---
description: >-
  #767: the group-to-group edge needs three bends, and its middle run would cross service C,
  which the other two edges put between the groups. It goes round C.
---
architecture-beta
  group g(cloud)[G]
  service a(server)[A] in g
  group h(database)[H]
  service b(server)[B] in h
  service c(server)[C]
  a:B -- T:c
  b:T -- B:c
  a{group}:R -- L:b{group}
